{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"BIT-pillow-2026-112406","published":"2026-10-26T05:55:50.663Z","modified":"2026-10-26T08:56:13.538142549Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-112406","GHSA-f2g6-542v-9j58"],"summary":"Pillow: Infinite loop in PdfParser.rewrite_pages on page tree Parent cycle","details":"Pillow is a Python imaging library. From 5.1.0 until 13.0.0, Pillow can enter an infinite loop while rewriting PDF pages. PdfParser.rewrite_pages() follows Parent relationships without detecting a cycle in the page tree. An attacker can supply a cyclic PDF to an application that appends an image to that PDF. This can hold the worker at full CPU and deny service. This issue is fixed in version 13.0.0.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"pillow","ecosystem":"Bitnami","purl":"pkg:bitnami/pillow"},"ranges":[{"type":"SEMVER","events":[{"introduced":"5.1.0"},{"fixed":"13.0.0"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/bitnami/vulndb/tree/main/data/pillow/BIT-pillow-2026-112406.json"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V4","score":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:X/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X"}]}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/commit/b3ebf20c694f2f12537a629c30229a1d5a53f777"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/releases/tag/13.0.0"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/security/advisories/GHSA-f2g6-542v-9j58"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-112406"}],"database_specific":{"cpes":["cpe:2.3:a:python:pillow:*:*:*:*:*:python:*:*"],"severity":"High"}}